IT:
Quando arriva il solstizio d'estate,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
si può dire che l'estate inizia per
davvero! Evvai!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Però stai attent{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} alle insolazioni,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}"The longest day of the year."{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
When I was a kid,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hearing that
would really get me fired up!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Doesn't it make it sound like you
can play even longer than normal?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Nowadays{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}the first thought that
runs through my head is, "It's really
hot outside!"
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Awwww man,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} just listen to me!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I've become one of those good-for-
nothing adults!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}"El día más largo del año."{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
De niño oía eso y pensaba:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
"¡Más tiempo para jugar!".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ahora solo pienso en el calor
que hace.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Creo que me estoy haciendo viejo
pero de verdad.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}“Yılın en uzun günü.”{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Çocukken{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bunu duyunca acayip heyecanlanırdım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Normalden daha uzun oynayabilirmişsin gibi
geliyor, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Şimdiyse{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}aklıma ilk gelen şey “Dışarısı
çok sıcak!” oluyor.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Offf be,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} şu söylediklerime bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İşe yaramaz yetişkinlerden birine dönüşmüşüm!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}El sol sale muy pero que muy
prontico en verano.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aunque a mí me da igual.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Si puedo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
yo soy más de dormir hasta el
mediodía.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
J'en ai une bonne. {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Il paraît qu'on est
censés se lever plus tôt en été, à
cause de la lumière du soleil...
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je sais pas toi, mais moi sans réveil,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
je dors toute la journée !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¿No crees que hay mucha humedad?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿O será que, como el día es largo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
me da más tiempo a sudar?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}En fin, quejarme no va a ayudar.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Será mejor pensar en otra cosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Neyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bugün sana da özellikle nemli
gelmiyor mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Günün uzun olmasından mı acaba?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ama bütün gün suçu zavallı Güneş Bey'e
atmanın da anlamı yok! Bir işe yaramaz!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
